{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1349905-quick-angel-ideas","id":1349905,"title":"Quick Angel Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-20T13:20:01-08:00","id":1349905,"title":"Quick Angel Ideas","content":"In the same spirit of the Plot Ideas thread I thought it might be interesting to bat around some angel ideas:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Teddy - Teddy bear shaped Guardian Angel designed to protect a child. Ban - Cannot move while adults can see it. Bane - Bear Claw Donuts.</li> <li>Health Inspector - Destroyer Angel designed to destroy restaurants by summoning vermin. Ban - Must eat a bit of any offered food. Bane - Ghost Pepper.</li> <li>Matchmaker - Psychopomp Angel designed to forge relationships between two individuals. Ban - Must read every love letter it comes across. Bane - Rose Thorns.</li> <li>Gunman - Destroyer Hunter Angel designed to clear an area of mortals, via Merciless Gunman, in order to flush out Demons. Ban - Must always keep its gun loaded. Bane - Knives brought to a gunfight.</li> <li>IT Technician - Guardian Angel designed to protect the computer system of a building from Demonic attacks. Ban - Must correct any misquoted sci-fi movie quotes. Bane - AOL Trial CDs.</li> <li>Garbageman - Psychopomp Angel designed to transport raw materials for the God-Machine in its garbage truck. Ban - Cannot affect recycle bins. Bane - Bleach.</li> <li>Cook - Destroyer Angel designed to poison a particular person's meal. In some cases making it look like a normal case of food poisoning. Ban - Cannot eat what they cook. Bane - Food Critic Reviews.</li> <li>Courier - Messenger Angel designed to deliver letters and orders without stopping. Ban - Must always run. Bane - Stiletto shoes.</li> <li>Reporter - Messenger Angel designed to create &quot;fake news&quot; stories to convey hidden messages. Ban - Must deliver the weather forecast if asked. Bane - Yellowed Newspaper.</li> </ol>Feel free to add to the list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}